WEBVTT

00:07.740 --> 00:08.820
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

00:08.820 --> 00:11.830
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
Field Trip

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
Groups

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
3-6 people per group

01:32.150 --> 01:34.990
Honestly, I don't think we need to spend 
too much time at the science museum, do we?

01:34.990 --> 01:40.000
Episode 9

01:34.990 --> 01:40.000
I Went On a

01:34.990 --> 01:40.000
Field Trip With the Girl I Like

01:35.450 --> 01:40.530
Let's spend enough time to write our report 
and try to get as much free time as we can.

01:40.530 --> 01:43.380
I guess the other question is: 
"what else there is in the area?"

01:45.270 --> 01:47.540
Komura, are you listening?

01:48.530 --> 01:49.760
Komura!

01:51.310 --> 01:52.550
Sorry, what?

01:52.880 --> 01:55.460
You haven't been paying attention at all.

01:56.850 --> 01:58.120
Sorry. Really.

01:58.120 --> 01:59.290
It's fine.

01:59.290 --> 02:00.790
Go join Mie-san's group.

02:01.520 --> 02:02.960
Don't "Eh?!" me.

02:02.960 --> 02:04.660
It's so obvious.

02:04.660 --> 02:06.770
You've been looking in Mie-san's 
direction the whole time.

02:07.210 --> 02:07.880
Nah.

02:07.880 --> 02:08.780
No way.

02:09.280 --> 02:10.600
I don't know what you're talking about.

02:10.890 --> 02:14.040
She might actually forget 
her glasses, after all.

02:14.610 --> 02:17.460
I think you ought to be around for her sake.

02:20.290 --> 02:23.490
Is that how people see us?

02:23.970 --> 02:26.000
It's so obvious!

02:26.630 --> 02:27.800
<i>It's true, though.</i>

02:27.800 --> 02:30.250
<i>I'm pretty worried about that.</i>

02:30.460 --> 02:38.760
Mie-san lost in a mysterious forest

02:30.790 --> 02:33.660
<i>A field trip means we're outside.</i>

02:33.660 --> 02:36.000
<i>And we're going quite far.</i>

02:34.090 --> 02:38.760
Lost...

02:34.210 --> 02:38.760
Mie-san wandering onto the road,
about to be hit by a car

02:36.000 --> 02:38.760
<i>What if she forgets her glasses?</i>

02:39.160 --> 02:40.610
<i>I'm so worried.</i>

02:40.610 --> 02:43.600
<i>I want to be in her group, just in case.</i>

02:44.050 --> 02:47.600
<i>I don't have the courage to join 
her group by myself, though...</i>

02:48.780 --> 02:51.150
How many people could we 
have in each group again?

02:52.450 --> 02:54.150
I think six.

02:58.030 --> 02:59.850
All right, fine, then.

02:59.850 --> 03:02.100
We'll join them with you.

03:02.100 --> 03:03.660
R-Really?

03:04.300 --> 03:06.640
But who's going to talk to them?

03:06.640 --> 03:08.660
You gotta put in some work, too.

03:09.440 --> 03:10.660
I guess I do, huh?

03:10.660 --> 03:12.630
Mie-chan, are you listening?

03:12.630 --> 03:14.420
Sorry, what?

03:14.420 --> 03:18.020
Be careful not to forget 
your glasses, Mie-chan.

03:18.020 --> 03:20.140
It's not often that we get such a big trip.

03:20.140 --> 03:22.060
That won't be a problem.

03:22.060 --> 03:24.110
I have a plan this time,

03:24.110 --> 03:25.430
so that I don't forget.

03:25.860 --> 03:27.030
What's the plan?

03:27.990 --> 03:30.430
Have a spare pair of glasses in my bag.

03:30.430 --> 03:31.440
Nothing special...

03:31.790 --> 03:34.140
Why don't you do that all the time?

03:34.140 --> 03:36.200
W-Well, I mean...

03:36.200 --> 03:39.940
I want to leave a pair at home when I can.

03:39.940 --> 03:43.170
That's not an option this time, though.

03:43.170 --> 03:44.700
I see.

03:45.710 --> 03:47.320
Well, wanna go invite him, then?

03:48.550 --> 03:51.710
Don't you want to be with Komura-kun?

03:52.340 --> 03:55.120
You've been glancing at him this whole time.

03:55.880 --> 03:57.960
No, but...

03:57.960 --> 04:01.130
What? Don't you want to invite him?

04:01.130 --> 04:02.680
Well...

04:03.280 --> 04:06.030
I do want to go with him.

04:06.650 --> 04:08.180
With Komura-kun.

04:13.190 --> 04:14.530
Morning.

04:14.530 --> 04:16.060
It's fourth block already.

04:16.410 --> 04:18.200
Perfect timing.

04:18.200 --> 04:21.730
We were just talking about 
inviting you guys into our group.

04:24.140 --> 04:25.460
Err...

04:25.460 --> 04:30.080
Komura-kun, see, Mie-chan 
might forget her glasses.

04:30.080 --> 04:34.520
Also, she has a habit of wasting 
money when she's in tourist mode.

04:34.520 --> 04:38.360
Worse, she tends to space out and get lost.

04:39.660 --> 04:41.360
We're counting on you.

04:41.360 --> 04:43.350
I guess it was already settled.

04:43.350 --> 04:45.840
Wait, you can't decide on your own!

04:45.840 --> 04:47.740
Sorry, Komura-kun.

04:47.740 --> 04:49.970
No, actually, we were...

04:51.350 --> 04:54.730
hoping we could join your group, too.

04:55.550 --> 04:58.550
That would make me really happy.

04:58.550 --> 05:00.110
She's so true to herself.

05:01.290 --> 05:04.730
Okay, so we're a six-person 
group, then, right?

05:04.730 --> 05:06.060
Looking forward to it.

05:06.060 --> 05:07.030
Same.

05:07.960 --> 05:09.080
Komura-kun.

05:09.080 --> 05:10.200
Y-Yes?

05:10.540 --> 05:13.690
Why did you decide to offer to join my group?

05:14.330 --> 05:16.210
A-Actually, well...

05:16.210 --> 05:18.920
It's really just a personal thing.

05:19.790 --> 05:20.950
Like...

05:23.370 --> 05:27.430
I was just hoping we could go together.

05:27.710 --> 05:28.900
Oh.

05:28.900 --> 05:32.180
We're thinking the same thing.

05:33.300 --> 05:36.060
I can't wait for the field trip.

05:36.510 --> 05:39.060
I'll feel safe with you around.

05:40.100 --> 05:42.070
Thank goodness.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.870
This is the place here.

06:02.200 --> 06:04.720
<i>Where did I put my spare glasses?</i>

06:04.720 --> 06:07.250
<i>I only have one pair...</i>

06:08.760 --> 06:09.890
<i>Found them.</i>

06:10.380 --> 06:11.050
<i>Okay.</i>

06:11.610 --> 06:12.390
<i>Good.</i>

06:15.680 --> 06:19.150
It's coming up tomorrow.

06:19.150 --> 06:20.860
I can't wait.

06:21.810 --> 06:26.470
I'm forgetful and people say I'm slow.

06:26.470 --> 06:28.180
And I'm stupid.

06:28.870 --> 06:34.910
So I have to be really careful not to cause 
trouble for Komura-kun and the others.

06:36.460 --> 06:38.140
Mie-san, Mie-san!

06:38.140 --> 06:39.980
That looks good!

06:39.980 --> 06:42.420
Mie-san, let's go over there next.

06:46.870 --> 06:48.590
<i>I can't sleep.</i>

06:49.300 --> 06:51.490
<i>I'm too excited.</i>

06:57.930 --> 06:59.580
You're finally here.

07:00.740 --> 07:02.940
Sorry I'm late.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.160
I overslept.

07:05.160 --> 07:07.660
I was too excited to sleep yesterday.

07:07.660 --> 07:08.570
Huh?

07:09.010 --> 07:10.570
Is Mie-san not here yet, either?

07:10.570 --> 07:12.470
Sorry I'm late!

07:12.470 --> 07:13.570
Mie-chan.

07:20.610 --> 07:21.960
Mie-chan...

07:23.570 --> 07:28.840
I ran on my way here and 
tripped and stepped on them.

07:29.500 --> 07:30.300
Mie-chan!

07:30.300 --> 07:31.950
It's okay.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.830
I brought my spare glasses.

07:33.830 --> 07:35.550
Thank goodness.

07:35.550 --> 07:37.070
We're boarding the bus!

07:35.550 --> 07:40.560
<b>Class 3-B</b>

07:37.070 --> 07:38.490
Get outside!

07:38.490 --> 07:39.750
We barely made it!

07:40.910 --> 07:42.110
Hurry up!

07:43.060 --> 07:45.380
Spare glasses, spare glasses...

07:47.120 --> 07:47.920
Found them.

07:47.920 --> 07:49.690
Th-That's a relief.

07:49.690 --> 07:54.770
The two other things Mie-chan has to be 
careful of is getting lost and overspending.

07:54.770 --> 07:55.700
I'll do my best.

07:56.240 --> 07:59.370
<i>One moment I was relieved, 
and now I'm nervous again.</i>

07:59.370 --> 08:02.210
<i>I'm about to go on a vacation with Mie-san.</i>

08:02.210 --> 08:03.460
Komura-kun.

08:04.150 --> 08:05.300
Y-Yes?

08:07.450 --> 08:10.260
I'm really looking forward to today.

08:12.000 --> 08:14.510
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

08:14.890 --> 08:19.150
When we went to Kamakura together...

08:20.030 --> 08:21.010
Kamakura?

08:21.010 --> 08:22.700
Did I buy something?

08:22.700 --> 08:24.560
See? You don't even remember!

08:24.860 --> 08:26.760
You bought fake glasses just because

08:26.760 --> 08:29.860
you thought the frame was cute, even 
though you have no use for them!

08:30.490 --> 08:33.020
Like, I get it, but...

08:37.500 --> 08:39.960
Her actual
spare glasses

08:37.860 --> 08:39.950
<i>Her actual spare glasses.</i>

08:40.000 --> 08:42.960
Non-prescription
fake glasses

08:43.310 --> 08:49.020
<i>I'm certain today's going to 
be an unforgettable day for me.</i>

09:06.580 --> 09:09.520
I'll collect everyone's reports later.

09:13.790 --> 09:18.160
<i>I don't think Mie-san can see 
the exhibit to write her report.</i>

09:19.020 --> 09:26.040
<i>The reason being that she accidentally 
brought her fake glasses today.</i>

09:26.040 --> 09:27.690
It's pretty awesome, huh?

09:27.690 --> 09:28.650
Y-Yeah.

09:28.650 --> 09:31.300
<i>She's pretending she can see, but...</i>

09:31.910 --> 09:35.470
<i>Mie-san's been looking 
forward to the field trip,</i>

09:35.470 --> 09:38.230
<i>and she was trying so hard 
not to forget her glasses.</i>

09:39.820 --> 09:41.810
<i>She must be disappointed.</i>

09:43.000 --> 09:46.480
<i>I want to help, but I don't 
want to be insensitive.</i>

09:52.180 --> 09:53.350
Mie-san!

10:00.620 --> 10:02.700
S-Sorry.

10:02.700 --> 10:04.800
I got dizzy.

10:04.800 --> 10:06.650
No, I'm sorry.

10:07.670 --> 10:09.040
Mie-san, look.

10:11.850 --> 10:14.830
I thought this might be easier to see.

10:17.890 --> 10:19.100
Did you know?

10:19.100 --> 10:21.080
No, err, well...

10:21.710 --> 10:22.960
I'm sorry.

10:24.460 --> 10:27.100
I can't believe I forgot my 
glasses again, today of all days.

10:27.570 --> 10:29.240
I-It's okay.

10:29.240 --> 10:33.010
You didn't forget them.
You just brought the wrong ones!

10:33.010 --> 10:34.420
Thanks.

10:38.740 --> 10:41.930
<i>She </i>really<i> doesn't need to worry about it.</i>

10:41.930 --> 10:44.620
<i>What could I say to help ease her?</i>

10:44.620 --> 10:45.710
Um...

10:46.490 --> 10:50.370
I like being helpful to you.

10:50.370 --> 10:52.330
<i>No, gross!</i>

10:52.330 --> 10:53.590
<i>That was so gross!</i>

10:53.590 --> 10:55.170
<i>Who do I think I am?</i>

10:55.170 --> 10:57.380
No, never mind. I...

11:07.680 --> 11:08.890
Thanks.

11:10.390 --> 11:12.420
I'll write my report on this.

11:14.390 --> 11:17.650
Don't mind me. You can go look around.

11:21.950 --> 11:25.700
<i>I feel like she pushed me away.</i>

11:26.200 --> 11:28.310
<i>I guess that was gross, right?</i>

11:28.890 --> 11:31.210
<i>That was definitely gross.</i>

11:31.980 --> 11:34.580
Mie-chan, we're going.

11:35.990 --> 11:38.510
<i>I have a feeling she's 
keeping her distance from me.</i>

11:38.940 --> 11:40.090
<i>This is bad.</i>

11:40.090 --> 11:42.010
<i>I might cry.</i>

11:47.680 --> 11:49.520
<b>Mirai Technology Museum</b>

11:54.300 --> 11:55.110
Huh?

11:56.610 --> 11:57.850
Who are you?

11:57.850 --> 11:59.630
You must have the wrong people.

11:59.630 --> 12:01.100
S-Sorry!

12:01.100 --> 12:02.360
Nah.

12:11.570 --> 12:12.660
There she is.

12:12.660 --> 12:14.400
Mie-san!

12:14.400 --> 12:16.790
Good thing you were pretty close by.

12:16.790 --> 12:18.120
Sorry.

12:16.790 --> 12:21.800
<b>I got lost. Outside.</b>

12:16.790 --> 12:21.800
<b>?! Just stay put!</b>

12:16.790 --> 12:21.800
<b>Can you open your map and take a
screenshot?</b>

12:18.840 --> 12:20.410
Was everything okay?

12:22.390 --> 12:25.210
<i>She's still relying on me.</i>

12:25.210 --> 12:28.310
<i>Which means maybe she 
isn't grossed out by me.</i>

12:29.330 --> 12:30.410
Sorry...

12:30.410 --> 12:32.610
I was thinking things over,

12:32.610 --> 12:36.970
but if I act on my own 
and get even more lost,

12:36.970 --> 12:39.940
I'll cause even more trouble.

12:39.940 --> 12:42.360
I-It's not trouble.

12:46.330 --> 12:47.230
Sorry.

12:47.230 --> 12:49.530
No, I'm sorry.

12:49.530 --> 12:55.750
Every time you cheer me up, I feel 
relieved, and I hate that about me.

12:56.440 --> 12:58.670
I want to get it together.

12:58.670 --> 13:01.250
I keep making you worry about me.

13:01.930 --> 13:05.260
I can't keep depending on you.

13:07.850 --> 13:09.840
I-It's fine.

13:09.840 --> 13:12.430
You aren't troubling me.

13:15.000 --> 13:17.420
So, well...

13:24.820 --> 13:25.980
Sorry.

13:25.980 --> 13:28.030
I'm such a nuisance.

13:30.960 --> 13:32.410
You really...

13:32.900 --> 13:36.210
<i>You really, really, really 
don't need to worry about it.</i>

13:36.210 --> 13:38.420
<i>Please don't get upset at yourself for this.</i>

13:41.420 --> 13:43.420
<i>I'm...</i>

13:43.420 --> 13:45.380
He sits next to me. {e2 9m31s}

13:45.380 --> 13:46.090
Right.

13:53.730 --> 13:55.890
So that's what you look like. {e1 22m37s}

14:01.040 --> 14:02.510
<i>That happens to me, too.</i>

14:02.510 --> 14:06.400
<i>You can't help but hate yourself 
when you feel like that.</i>

14:06.400 --> 14:10.410
<i>I didn't want you to know, and 
I never wanted to tell you,</i>

14:10.800 --> 14:13.790
<i>but your sense of guilt is endearing.</i>

14:14.550 --> 14:16.290
<i>Please don't let it get to you.</i>

14:19.730 --> 14:21.530
Mie-san, see...

14:23.520 --> 14:28.950
Every day, I'm wishing you'd 
forget your glasses the next day.

14:35.140 --> 14:38.060
Wh-Why?

14:52.500 --> 14:55.580
Because I like being of help to you.

14:56.970 --> 15:00.580
So really, you don't have to worry about it.

15:05.250 --> 15:06.340
Sorry.

15:12.130 --> 15:13.180
No.

15:13.750 --> 15:15.080
Thanks.

15:25.590 --> 15:28.650
<i>I think she might hate me.</i>

15:29.660 --> 15:32.880
<i>She wouldn't talk to me at all after that.</i>

15:34.620 --> 15:37.310
<i>Of course she wouldn't, 
after what I told her.</i>

15:37.310 --> 15:39.660
<i>How am I supposed to face her from tomorrow?</i>

15:39.660 --> 15:40.870
Hey...

15:41.930 --> 15:46.440
I still think you're a 
bit too nice, Komura-kun.

15:46.440 --> 15:49.050
N-No, it's not that I'm nice.

15:59.650 --> 16:01.230
M-Mie-san, um...

16:01.230 --> 16:04.400
I can't believe you're happy 
that I'm causing you trouble.

16:05.610 --> 16:10.110
But actually, it made me really happy.

16:16.660 --> 16:19.640
<i>I guess she doesn't hate me.</i>

16:26.160 --> 16:31.760
Every day, I'm wishing you'd 
forget your glasses the next day.

16:33.630 --> 16:36.680
Because I like being of help to you.

16:36.960 --> 16:42.310
<i>I'm still thinking about the 
words Komura-kun told me.</i>

16:42.740 --> 16:46.400
<i>It doesn't bother him 
when I forget my glasses.</i>

16:46.400 --> 16:49.710
<i>It's okay because he likes helping me.</i>

16:49.710 --> 16:52.320
<i>In fact, he wants me to forget my glasses.</i>

16:52.320 --> 16:56.820
<i>Komura-kun's so kind, I don't 
really even understand him.</i>

16:56.820 --> 17:01.080
<i>I'm sure he just said that to cheer me up.</i>

17:01.080 --> 17:03.970
<i>Maybe it's because I was 
thinking about stuff</i>

17:03.970 --> 17:07.110
<i>the whole time that I forgot 
my glasses again today.</i>

17:07.790 --> 17:11.950
<i>But I can't keep depending on his kindness.</i>

17:13.040 --> 17:14.590
<i>Come to think of it...</i>

17:20.040 --> 17:21.520
M-Mie-san.

17:22.150 --> 17:23.270
Morning.

17:24.240 --> 17:25.020
Morning.

17:26.250 --> 17:28.720
<i>They're so bumpy.</i>

17:28.720 --> 17:30.020
Hey, Mie-san...

17:31.170 --> 17:36.340
I said some weird stuff 
during the field trip.

17:37.510 --> 17:40.940
No, I made you worry about me.

17:40.940 --> 17:43.660
No, I don't mind.

17:43.660 --> 17:48.670
I'm going to try not to 
have to depend on you.

17:48.670 --> 17:53.370
I forgot my glasses again today, but 
I'm forcing myself to wear contacts.

17:54.480 --> 17:57.800
I'm not used to them yet, but that's 
what I'm going to do from now on.

17:58.330 --> 17:59.650
Okay.

18:09.030 --> 18:11.030
Err, um...

18:11.530 --> 18:13.440
Don't stress yourself out, though.

18:19.570 --> 18:20.620
What's wrong?

18:21.550 --> 18:23.660
Just thinking about something.

18:23.660 --> 18:25.170
Do your eyes hurt?

18:26.010 --> 18:29.170
You don't need to force 
yourself to wear contacts.

18:29.470 --> 18:34.170
It's suddenly started bothering you 
lately that you forget your glasses.

18:34.870 --> 18:37.170
I-It's always bothered me.

18:37.170 --> 18:41.430
I think Komura-kun likes 
being depended on, though.

18:43.930 --> 18:46.430
<b>Yasaka-kun</b>

18:47.660 --> 18:50.690
Did you get close to Yasaka-kun?

18:57.000 --> 18:58.910
I'm gonna go reply.

19:01.460 --> 19:03.910
Th-This is big news, Mie-chan.

19:03.910 --> 19:05.930
Asuka-chan's in love!

19:06.410 --> 19:07.160
Love?

19:07.530 --> 19:10.410
She must like Yasaka-kun!

19:10.410 --> 19:11.880
That's a good thing.

19:11.880 --> 19:12.830
It's not.

19:12.830 --> 19:14.920
It is, but it's not.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.240
That face...

19:16.240 --> 19:17.470
Her face...

19:17.470 --> 19:19.920
She likes him in a special way!

19:26.430 --> 19:29.930
History | Same as usual
 English | Same as usual
 Science | Normal
 Math | Tokita-kun got a question right
 Geography | Normal
 Language | Normal
 <b>Class today</b>
 Everyone seemed well as usual

19:29.930 --> 19:31.990
<i>Special...</i>

19:31.990 --> 19:33.810
<i>What's special?</i>

19:34.810 --> 19:36.320
<b>LOVE</b>

19:34.810 --> 19:36.320
She's in love!

19:35.070 --> 19:36.320
<b></b>She's in 
love!

19:37.830 --> 19:41.730
<i>"Like" as in, she wants to be 
in a relationship with him?</i>

19:44.100 --> 19:47.980
<i>I don't really understand that kind of thing.</i>

19:49.650 --> 19:50.980
Thank you.

19:51.900 --> 19:53.130
Komura-kun.

19:54.020 --> 19:56.880
I came to hand the class 
record to our teacher.

19:56.880 --> 19:58.280
H-Hey...

19:58.280 --> 19:59.830
Were you all right today?

19:59.830 --> 20:00.730
With your contacts.

20:00.730 --> 20:03.000
Oh, yeah, I made it.

20:03.000 --> 20:04.140
Th-That's good.

20:09.010 --> 20:10.640
Still, though...

20:11.300 --> 20:13.900
They're bumpy and annoying.

20:14.280 --> 20:17.650
I think I still like it more 
when you're helping me.

20:23.130 --> 20:24.160
Y-Yeah.

20:24.570 --> 20:26.670
As long as you're okay with that.

20:32.490 --> 20:35.330
Komura-kun, look at me.

20:37.460 --> 20:38.610
Sorry.

20:38.610 --> 20:39.940
Can I see your face?

20:40.770 --> 20:42.850
<i>He looks so happy.</i>

20:42.850 --> 20:48.540
<i>Komura-kun really is happy 
when I forget my glasses.</i>

20:48.540 --> 20:51.770
<i>He's really too nice. I don't get it.</i>

20:51.770 --> 20:54.900
<i>But that's not all it is.</i>

20:54.900 --> 20:57.100
<i>What was this face?</i>

20:57.690 --> 20:58.900
<i>I've seen it before...</i>

21:18.950 --> 21:22.880
<i>I wonder if I'm special to Komura-kun.</i>

21:27.130 --> 21:29.730
<i>That would be great.</i>

21:29.730 --> 21:30.890
<i>Really.</i>

21:32.450 --> 21:33.630
<i>I see.</i>

21:34.590 --> 21:38.900
<i>It must be the same for me, too.</i>

23:10.900 --> 23:12.350
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.350 --> 23:14.030
I'm going to do the next episode preview.

23:14.030 --> 23:20.030
"Mie-san forgot her glasses again, and 
had her face close to Komura-kun again.

23:20.030 --> 23:24.540
Someya-san saw that and 
thought they were kissing."

23:24.860 --> 23:26.320
Kissing?!

23:26.320 --> 23:27.740
Someya-san...

23:27.740 --> 23:28.970
Wait, wait, wait!

23:28.970 --> 23:30.470
That's a misunderstanding!

23:30.470 --> 23:31.780
What do I do?

23:31.780 --> 23:34.680
People are going to get the 
wrong idea about Mie-san!

23:34.680 --> 23:35.370
N-Next episode:

23:34.680 --> 23:39.860
Episode 10

23:34.680 --> 23:39.860
